Bibhuti Bhusan Mandal and Kaushik Dey, IIT Kharagpur. Underground Mining of Metalliferous Deposits, NPTEL 123105006. [Official course](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/123105006) · [Syllabus and scope](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/123105006.pdf).

Work the complete public course on deposit characterization, evaluation, access/development, method selection, stoping/caving and related systems, supporting operations, and engineering context. Distinguish geological suitability, production requirements, and actual operating constraints rather than selecting a method from a single diagram.

The official page identifies both instructors; the indexed syllabus was available while a direct PDF request timed out. This is not represented as full inspection or playback of all media. Preserve course/run and component rights. Identity and access limits checked on 29 October 2026. Course material remains external and practical operation requires its actual professional setting.

